[00:01.12]1. Gracious Jehovah, we praise you and thank you.
[00:09.38]Father, we make these expressions in prayer.
[00:18.32]Trusting in you, we will serve you completely,
[00:26.22]Knowing we thrive under your tender care.
[00:35.62]Daily our errors reveal imperfection.
[00:42.98]For our transgressions forgiveness we seek.
[00:53.38]Thankful we are that our lives have been ransomed.
[01:01.18]Thankful we are that you know we are weak.
[01:10.96]2. Grateful we are that you show love and kindness.
[01:18.66]Thank you for drawing us closer to you.
[01:26.44]Teach us to know you, and help us to serve you.
[01:33.76]Show us the way to be loyal and true.
[01:42.96]Thankful we are for your powerful spirit.
[01:50.48]Grateful we are for the courage to speak.
[02:00.92]May we be humble and happy to serve you;
[02:08.16]May we give thanks, for you favor the meek.
